'''Love is Sickness''' (コイの五月病, ''Koi no Gogatsubyō'', '''Koi May Disease''') is the May event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.5 Update|Version 2.2.5]].

==Event==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Love is Sickness'''}} is back in the Battle Cats!<br>
Visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} and join Koi Cat on a journey through the strange transition into adulthood<br>
The only thing that stands in your way of your dreams is... a shiba in heavy battle armor? Why would you do this, {{Color|#FF9900|'''Samurai Doggy?!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available May 1st (11:00am) thru June 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Koi Cat'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|100%}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|Treasure Radar item}}!)

※ After you have picked up Koi Cat, unlock it at the {{Color|#34A853|Rare Cats}} section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Koi Cat from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

